# Festag Night — dark mode tokens

Canonical source: `lib/design-tokens/dark.ts` → applied in `app/globals.css` `[data-theme="dark"]`.

Foundation: Festag primary slate **`#5B647D`** (same as the Google CTA). Cool graphite–slate ladder — not forest green, not OLED pure black, not neon blue.

## Ladder

| Layer | Token | Value |
|---|---|---|
| Canvas | `--festag-black-canvas` | `#0B0C10` |
| Content | `--festag-black-content` | `#111318` |
| Card / Raised | `--festag-black-raised` | `#171A21` |
| Elevated / Popup | `--festag-black-popup` | `#1C2028` |
| Peak | `--festag-black-peak` | `#222631` |
| Hover | `--hover` | `#262A35` |
| Ink | `--festag-night-ink` | `#E8EAF0` |
| Secondary | `--festag-night-ink-2` | `#C4C8D4` |
| Muted | `--festag-night-ink-3` | `#8B909E` |
| Primary (brand) | `--festag-primary` | `#5B647D` |

## Rules

1. Brand / ready / primary CTAs use Festag slate `#5B647D` — never neon (`#295CFF`) and never forest green fills.
2. Soft cool ink (`#E8EAF0`) — not pure white body text.
3. Full pill buttons (`999px`) everywhere.
4. Quiet hairlines (`--festag-night-line` ~6% white).
5. Semantic green `#2E9B52` only for success / ok badges — not for primary CTAs in dark.
6. Cards radius `20px`, motion `220ms ease-out`.
7. Input focus = slate stroke `#5B647D` only — no glow ring.
8. Selected nav = soft slate wash (`rgba(91,100,125,0.32)`).

## Do not

- Reintroduce forest green canvases (`#0B0F0D` / `#111816` / `#161F1C`)
- Neon / saturated blues as CTA fills
- Colored glow shadows on CTAs
- Pure `#000000` canvas or pure `#FFFFFF` body text in dark
- Fork a second color ladder in auth/Tagro/popup
